      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:4c9cdc3e-dc08-4f17-882c-b2c397fa49a2/6f15e6ba-2ecf-45ca-9bc4-bd6fc2c6558c/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:4c9cdc3e-dc08-4f17-882c-b2c397fa49a2/6f15e6ba-2ecf-45ca-9bc4-bd6fc2c6558c/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:4c9cdc3e-dc08-4f17-882c-b2c397fa49a2/6f15e6ba-2ecf-45ca-9bc4-bd6fc2c6558c/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:4c9cdc3e-dc08-4f17-882c-b2c397fa49a2/6f15e6ba-2ecf-45ca-9bc4-bd6fc2c6558c/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Peter Murray (test/user account)",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A4c9cdc3e-dc08-4f17-882c-b2c397fa49a2",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "[Followup from Sourceforge Tracker]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Followup Submitter: datagazetteer",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Logged In: YES ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "user_id=1572168",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Originator: NO",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I like the idea of an interceptor to log and return a unique event id back to the caller.  This would seem to imply a structured, well-defined form of an error entity body that would be returned by Fedora in the event of such a non-2xx response code from the disseminator.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "One downside might come in the form of a client that is not behaving RESTfully.  A client that tried to parse the entity body without looking at the response code to see if the request succeeded or failed would likely choke.  But, then again, they would choke now anyway...",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
