     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: cwilper<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=189298<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>Reasons it may not be appropriate to configure Fedora this way in production:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>security (exposing sensitive infrastructure details to the outside world)</li>\n\t<li>encapsulation (don't want clients to Fedora to be dependent on backend service impl details)</li>\n</ul>\n",
